#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_PleasedToRateMonNickname"
msgid ""
"Hi, hi! I'm the NAME RATER!\n"
"I'm the fortune-teller of names!\p"
"I shall be pleased to rate your\n"
"POKéMON's nickname.$"
msgstr ""
"你好你好！我是姓名鉴定师！\n"
"是名字的占卜师！\p"
"我很乐意为你的宝可梦的昵称打分。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:70
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_CritiqueWhichMonNickname"
msgid ""
"Which POKéMON's nickname should\n"
"I critique?$"
msgstr "要我评价哪只宝可梦的昵称呢？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_FineNameSuggestBetterOne"
msgid ""
"Hmmm… {STR_VAR_1}, is it? That is\n"
"quite a fine name you bestowed.\p"
"But! What say you, if I were to\n"
"suggest a slightly better name?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……叫{STR_VAR_1}是吧？\n"
"你取的这个名字相当不错。\p"
"但是！如果我给你推荐一个更好一点的\n"
"名字，你觉得怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_WhatShallNewNameBe"
msgid ""
"Ah, good. Then, what shall the new\n"
"nickname be?$"
msgstr "啊，很好。那么，新的昵称要叫什么呢？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_MonShallBeKnownAsName"
msgid ""
"Done! From now on, this POKéMON\n"
"shall be known as {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It is a better name than before!\n"
"How fortunate for you!$"
msgstr ""
"好了！从今以后，\n"
"这只宝可梦就叫{STR_VAR_1}了！\p"
"这个名字比以前的更好！你真幸运！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:90
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_DoVisitAgain"
msgid ""
"I see.\n"
"Do come visit again.$"
msgstr "这样啊。欢迎再来哦。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:94
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_NameNoDifferentYetSuperior"
msgid ""
"Done! From now on, this POKéMON\n"
"shall be known as {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It looks no different from before,\n"
"and yet, this is vastly superior!\p"
"How fortunate for you!$"
msgstr ""
"好了！从今以后，\n"
"这只宝可梦就叫{STR_VAR_1}了！\p"
"虽然看起来和以前没什么不同，\n"
"但其实要好上许多！\p"
"你真幸运！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:101
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_MagnificentName"
msgid ""
"Hmmm… {STR_VAR_1} it is!\p"
"This is a magnificent nickname!\n"
"It is impeccably beyond reproach!\p"
"You'll do well to cherish your\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} now and beyond.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……{STR_VAR_1}，是吧！\p"
"真是个了不起的昵称！\n"
"完美无缺，无可挑剔！\p"
"今后你也要好好珍惜你的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}哦。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "SlateportCity_NameRatersHouse_Text_ThatIsMerelyAnEgg"
msgid ""
"Now, now.\n"
"That is merely an EGG!$"
msgstr "哎呀哎呀，那只不过是一颗蛋而已！$"
